    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Can you tell me when it first started?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:33",
      "end_timestamp": "00:37",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Uh, it's been four weeks, I'm fairly sure.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:37",
      "end_timestamp": "00:42",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "How strong would you say it is?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:44",
      "end_timestamp": "00:47",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Maybe a six out of ten on a bad day.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:51",
      "end_timestamp": "00:57",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I was getting to that! And there's not sleeping for days as well, about two weeks now.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:11",
      "end_timestamp": "01:20",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Is it a lot or only a little?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:22",
      "end_timestamp": "01:25",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Mm, I'd give it a three, out of ten. I did have a plan at one point, but that's gone now.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:31",
      "end_timestamp": "01:42",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]",
        "symptoms[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Have you had thoughts of ending your life before, or is this the first time?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:43",
      "end_timestamp": "01:50",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "A bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:52",
      "end_timestamp": "01:57",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "speaker_role": "unknown",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, exactly like that.",
